  message: "Fixed in PR #3213 (merged to dev). Root cause: pgrep -af substring-matched \"pytest|...\" against full cmdline, so inotifywait /tmp/pytest-.../foo was treated as live pytest. Fix: new .agent/hooks/_shared/watched_process.py matches argv[0]-anchored leading tokens (path-stripped, python-version-collapsed), with bash -c/sh -c still excluded. 30 tests cover the predicate, the pgrep-output parser, main(), and the subprocess CLI. stop_logic.sh now pipes pgrep through python3 watched_process.py. Verified: 4 leaked inotifywait helpers (etime 1h1m) killed; simulated reproducer confirms new filter returns exit=1 on inotifywait-with-/tmp/pytest-path cmdlines."  # cd0a
